OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIsolated coastal showers
OL,6,Finitially, these possibly spreading
OL,7,Finland for a time across eastern
OL,8,Fareas, before gradually mostly dying
OL,9,Faway later. Further west remaining
OL,10,Fdry, with a sunny start then patchy
OL,11,Fcloud and sunny intervals. Breezy
OL,12,Fcoastal conditions slowly ease.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FMainly dry at first with long
OL,15,Fclear periods. Later in the night
OL,16,Fscattered showers arrive along the
OL,17,Fcoast, perhaps pushing showers a
OL,18,Flittle way inland. Becoming chilly,
OL,19,Fwith light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,167,160,301,260,100,100
