OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FSome sunny spells, especially
OL,6,Fat first, but cloud increases and
OL,7,Fscattered showers continue for a while
OL,8,Falong and near the coast. Later most
OL,9,Fshowers die away and cloud breaks
OL,10,Fdevelop.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FOften
OL,13,Fcloudy with a chance of patchy rain
OL,14,FMonday and Tuesday, but also some
OL,15,Fdrier periods. Potentially spells of
OL,16,Fheavy rain for Wednesday. Temperatures
OL,17,Fwill be generally near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
